    "domain": "Natural Sciences",
    "framing": "How did physicists adjudicate between the competing accounts of the 2011 OPERA result that neutrinos had outpaced light, and what finally settled whether the anomaly reflected new physics or an instrumental artifact?",
    "split": "test",
